    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1010">

                <pb facs="0776" n="694" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg694"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-08-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 24,
                    1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Manuel Arriaga was to-day elected on first ballot President of Portugal by 121
                    votes of the Constituent Assembly. His principal opponent, Bernardino Machado,
                    received 86 votes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
